{
  "schema": "2.0",
  "config": {
    "update_multi": true
  },
  "header": {
    "title": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "投标文件比对报告"
    },
    "subtitle": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "任务 ${task_id}"
    },
    "template": "${header_template}"
  },
  "body": {
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**总体风险：** <text_tag color='${risk_color}'>${risk_level_label}</text_tag>\n**风险分数：** ${aggregate_score_100}/100\n**分析文件：** ${document_count} 份"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**结论摘要**\n${summary}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**优先复核项**\n${top_findings_markdown}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**建议动作**\n${recommended_actions_markdown}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "> 风险评分仅用于筛查优先级，不构成违规结论。AI 疑似度是非诊断性辅助信号，所有结果必须人工复核。"
      },
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "horizontal_align": "right",
        "horizontal_spacing": "8px",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "auto",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "button",
                "type": "primary",
                "text": {
                  "tag": "plain_text",
                  "content": "查看完整报告"
                },
                "behaviors": [
                  {
                    "type": "open_url",
                    "default_url": "${report_url}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
